No, let's decide. They decided exactly like Ribi Llezer. But by being Nimnu means Atal-Namitza. You understand? It was Samuti. You understand?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Samuti, Samuti is also in Bava Mishad Nun Tet, when the Pulemen Khereb.

